        },
        {
          "text": " Yino niyo elomo eya Amosi, owaba omwaayi khukhwama mu lukoba lwa Tekoa. Wele ekesia Amosi bibiindu bioosi biliekholekha khu Isiraeli, kimiiko kibili sibala ne sikhesisiikha tawe. Mu ndaalo echo Usia aba omwami owa Yuda ne Yeroboamu okhwa Yehoasi aba omwami owa Isiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
